[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10685.51, "timestamp": "02:58:05", "text": "谢谢。谢谢。我一直在自学。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10688.469, "timestamp": "02:58:08", "text": "自2020年伊始。苏，我不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10690.309, "timestamp": "02:58:10", "text": "我是专家，但我懂得足够多，可以参加……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10693.75, "timestamp": "02:58:13", "text": "基本连招。你最近怎么样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10698.87, "timestamp": "02:58:18", "text": "哦，那真不错。好的。嗯，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10702.07, "timestamp": "02:58:22", "text": "很高兴看到你有所进步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10705.269, "timestamp": "02:58:25", "text": "自从"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10707.269, "timestamp": "02:58:27", "text": "我的病情正在缓慢但稳步地好转。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10710.389, "timestamp": "02:58:30", "text": "哈哈。你能换一下你的呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10719.51, "timestamp": "02:58:39", "text": "哦，那如果你愿意的话，我可以换。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10723.349, "timestamp": "02:58:43", "text": "暂时把它翻译成日语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10738.469, "timestamp": "02:58:58", "text": "你好。"}]